  "prefLabel": "Per-A 203.06 Role of Agency Staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 203.06 Role of Agency Staff. The role of agency staff in an adjudicatory proceeding shall be to render clerical, administrative or other support to the board in connection with the proceeding.\n\nSource. #9205, eff 10-23-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per-a100-200.html"
